---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Casa de Dios | Iglesia Cristiana">
	
	<!-- Header / Navbar -->
	<header class="navbar">
		<div class="container nav-container">
			<a href="/" class="logo">
				<span class="logo-icon">✦</span>
				Casa de <span class="text-golden">Dios</span>
			</a>
			<nav class="nav-links">
				<a href="#inicio" class="nav-link">Inicio</a>
				<a href="#nosotros" class="nav-link">Nosotros</a>
				<a href="#ministerios" class="nav-link">Ministerios</a>
				<a href="#eventos" class="nav-link">Eventos</a>
			</nav>
			<div class="nav-actions">
				<a href="#donar" class="btn btn-outline" style="padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem;">Donar</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</header>

	<main>
		<!-- Hero Section -->
		<section id="inicio" class="hero">
			<div class="hero-bg"></div>
			<div class="hero-overlay"></div>
			<div class="container hero-content">
				<div class="hero-text animate-fade-up">
					<p class="hero-subtitle">Bienvenidos a casa</p>
					<h1 class="hero-title">Un lugar para encontrar<br/>paz y <span class="text-golden">esperanza</span></h1>
					<p class="hero-desc">Únete a nuestra familia de fe. Experimenta el amor incondicional de Dios y descubre tu propósito a través de Su gracia y poder salvador.</p>
					<div class="hero-cta">
						<a href="#visitanos" class="btn btn-golden">Planificá tu visita</a>
						<a href="#mensajes" class="btn btn-outline" style="color: white; border-color: white;">Últimos Mensajes</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<div class="hero-scroll-indicator">
				<span>Descubre más</span>
				<div class="scroll-arrow">↓</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Welcome/Beliefs Section -->
		<section id="nosotros" class="section bg-light">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="section-header text-center animate-fade-up">
					<span class="badge">Nuestra Esencia</span>
					<h2>Lo que Creemos</h2>
					<p class="section-subtitle">Somos una comunidad centrada en Cristo, creyendo en el poder transformador de Su palabra y el amor al prójimo.</p>
				</div>
				
				<div class="features-grid">
					<div class="feature-card animate-fade-up delay-100">
						<div class="feature-icon">✝️</div>
						<h3>Fe Cristocéntrica</h3>
						<p>Creemos en Jesús como el único camino, la verdad y la vida. Él es el fundamento de todo lo que hacemos y enseñamos en nuestra iglesia.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="feature-card animate-fade-up delay-200">
						<div class="feature-icon">📖</div>
						<h3>Fundamento Bíblico</h3>
						<p>La Biblia es nuestra guía absoluta. A través de ella descubrimos el corazón de Dios y la dirección perfecta para nuestras vidas cotidianas.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="feature-card animate-fade-up delay-300">
						<div class="feature-icon">🤝</div>
						<h3>Comunidad de Amor</h3>
						<p>Fomentamos relaciones auténticas donde cada persona es valorada, cuidada e impulsada a alcanzar su máximo potencial en Dios.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Experience Section with Imagery Placeholder -->
		<section id="experiencia" class="section">
			<div class="container experience-container">
				<div class="experience-content">
					<span class="badge">Únete a nosotros</span>
					<h2>Una Experiencia que Transforma Vidas</h2>
					<p>Cada domingo nos reunimos para celebrar, adorar y recibir una palabra de vida. No importa tu pasado o en qué etapa de la vida te encuentres, en Casa de Dios hay un asiento reservado para ti.</p>
					<ul class="experience-list">
						<li>
							<span class="check-icon">✓</span>
							Adoración contemporánea y profunda
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="check-icon">✓</span>
							Mensajes prácticos basados en la Biblia
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="check-icon">✓</span>
							Un ambiente seguro y divertido para los niños
						</li>
					</ul>
					<a href="#visitanos" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">Conoce nuestros horarios</a>
				</div>
				<div class="experience-image-wrapper">
					<!-- Uses a gradient placeholder for draft, representing a warm church gathering -->
					<div class="image-placeholder">
						<div class="glow-orb orb-1"></div>
						<div class="glow-orb orb-2"></div>
						<div class="glass-plate">
							<h3>Reuniones Semanales</h3>
							<p>Domingos 10:00 AM y 12:00 PM</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- CTA / Call to Action -->
		<section class="cta-section">
			<div class="cta-bg-shape"></div>
			<div class="container cta-container">
				<h2>¿Listo para dar el siguiente paso?</h2>
				<p>Ya sea que quieras unirte a un grupo pequeño, servir en un ministerio o simplemente estés buscando respuestas espirituales, estamos aquí para acompañarte.</p>
				<button class="btn btn-golden">Contacta con nosotros</button>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>

	<!-- Footer Minimalist Premium -->
	<footer class="footer">
		<div class="container footer-container">
			<div class="footer-brand">
				<a href="/" class="logo" style="color: white;">
					<span class="logo-icon text-golden">✦</span>
					Casa de <span class="text-golden">Dios</span>
				</a>
				<p>Llevando el amor y la luz de Cristo a cada hogar de nuestra ciudad.</p>
			</div>
			
			<div class="footer-links">
				<h4>Explorar</h4>
				<a href="#inicio">Inicio</a>
				<a href="#nosotros">Nosotros</a>
				<a href="#ministerios">Ministerios</a>
				<a href="#donar">Dar</a>
			</div>
			
			<div class="footer-links">
				<h4>Contacto</h4>
				<p>123 Avenida de Paz, Ciudad</p>
				<p>contacto@casadedios.ejemplo.com</p>
				<p>+1 234 567 890</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="footer-bottom">
			<p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Casa de Dios. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
		</div>
	</footer>

</Layout>

<style>
	/* Navbar overrides and scoped styles */
	.navbar {
		position: fixed;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		width: 100%;
		z-index: 1000;
		background: var(--glass-bg);
		backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
		box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);
		padding: 1rem 0;
		transition: var(--transition-smooth);
	}

	.nav-container {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.logo {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-primary);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}

	.logo-icon {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.nav-links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.nav-link {
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--color-text-light);
		position: relative;
	}

	.nav-link:hover {
		color: var(--color-primary);
	}

	.nav-link::after {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		width: 0%;
		height: 2px;
		bottom: -4px;
		left: 0;
		background-color: var(--color-accent);
		transition: var(--transition-smooth);
	}

	.nav-link:hover::after {
		width: 100%;
	}

	/* Common Section Padding */
	.section {
		padding: 6rem 0;
	}

	.section-header {
		max-width: 700px;
		margin: 0 auto 4rem auto;
	}

	.section-header h2 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.section-subtitle {
		color: var(--color-text-light);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	/* Badge */
	.badge {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
		background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.1);
		color: #B48E2D;
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 1.5px;
		border-radius: 50px;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	/* Hero Section */
	.hero {
		min-height: 100vh;
		position: relative;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		padding-top: 5rem; /* offset for navbar */
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.hero-bg {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, #172554 100%);
		z-index: -2;
	}

	/* Pseudo-element for a subtle divine glow effect */
	.hero-bg::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		top: -20%; left: 50%;
		width: 80vw; height: 80vw;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
		border-radius: 50%;
		z-index: -1;
	}

	.hero-overlay {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
		background: url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjgiPgo8cmVjdCB3aWR0aD0iOCIgaGVpZ2h0PSI4IiBmaWxsPSIjZmZmIiBmaWxsLW9wYWNpdHk9IjAuMDIiLz4KPC9zdmc+');
		z-index: -1;
	}

	.hero-content {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 10;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
		text-align: center;
		color: var(--color-white);
	}

	.hero-text {
		max-width: 800px;
	}

	.hero-subtitle {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 3px;
		color: var(--color-accent-light);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.hero-title {
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
		color: var(--color-white);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		line-height: 1.1;
		text-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
	}

	.hero-desc {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
		max-width: 650px;
		margin-left: auto;
		margin-right: auto;
	}

	.hero-cta {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.hero-scroll-indicator {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 2rem;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		opacity: 0;
		animation: fadeUp 1s ease-out 1s forwards;
	}

	.scroll-arrow {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		animation: bounce 2s infinite;
	}

	@keyframes bounce {
		0%, 20%, 50%, 80%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
		40% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
		60% { transform: translateY(-5px); }
	}

	/* Features Grid */
	.features-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.feature-card {
		background: var(--color-white);
		padding: 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 20px;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
		transition: var(--transition-smooth);
		border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
	}

	.feature-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-10px);
		box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
		border-color: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
	}

	.feature-icon {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 60px;
		height: 60px;
		background: var(--color-bg-alt);
		border-radius: 12px;
	}

	.feature-card h3 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		color: var(--color-primary);
	}

	.feature-card p {
		color: var(--color-text-light);
	}

	/* Experience Section */
	.experience-container {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 4rem;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.experience-content h2 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.experience-content p {
		color: var(--color-text-light);
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.experience-list {
		list-style: none;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.experience-list li {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		color: var(--color-text);
	}

	.check-icon {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 24px;
		height: 24px;
		background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15);
		color: var(--color-accent);
		border-radius: 50%;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: bold;
	}

	.image-placeholder {
		width: 100%;
		height: 450px;
		border-radius: 30px;
		background: linear-gradient(to right bottom, var(--color-bg-alt), #E2E8F0);
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
	}

	.glow-orb {
		position: absolute;
		border-radius: 50%;
		filter: blur(60px);
		z-index: 1;
	}

	.orb-1 {
		width: 300px;
		height: 300px;
		background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3); /* blue */
		top: -50px;
		left: -50px;
	}

	.orb-2 {
		width: 250px;
		height: 250px;
		background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3); /* gold */
		bottom: -50px;
		right: -50px;
	}

	.glass-plate {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 2;
		background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
		backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 16px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
		text-align: center;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
	}

	.glass-plate h3 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		color: var(--color-primary);
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	/* CTA Section */
	.cta-section {
		position: relative;
		padding: 6rem 0;
		background: var(--color-primary);
		color: var(--color-white);
		text-align: center;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.cta-bg-shape {
		position: absolute;
		top: -50%;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		width: 100%;
		height: 200%;
		background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.4) 0%, transparent 60%);
		z-index: 1;
	}

	.cta-container {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 2;
		max-width: 600px;
	}

	.cta-container h2 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		color: var(--color-white);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.cta-container p {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
		color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
	}

	/* Footer */
	.footer {
		background: #0F172A; /* very dark blue */
		color: var(--color-white);
		padding: 4rem 0 2rem 0;
	}

	.footer-container {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 3rem;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.footer-brand p {
		color: #94A3B8;
		margin-top: 1rem;
		max-width: 300px;
	}

	.footer-links h4 {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		color: var(--color-white);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		position: relative;
	}

	.footer-links h4::after {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		width: 30px;
		height: 2px;
		background: var(--color-accent);
		bottom: -0.5rem;
		left: 0;
	}

	.footer-links a, .footer-links p {
		display: block;
		color: #94A3B8;
		margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: var(--transition-smooth);
	}

	.footer-links a:hover {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		transform: translateX(5px);
	}

	.footer-bottom {
		text-align: center;
		padding-top: 2rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
		color: #64748B;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	/* Responsive */
	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.experience-container {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
		
		.image-placeholder {
			height: 350px;
		}

		.hero-title {
			font-size: 2.5rem;
		}

		.nav-links {
			display: none; /* simple mobile pattern for draft */
		}
		
		.footer-container {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 2rem;
		}
	}
	
	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.hero-cta {
			flex-direction: column;
		}
	}
</style>
